<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-10-14T12:12:38.522Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 12:12:38 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Joseph Kabila, former president of the Democratic Republic of Congo, has joined the M23 rebels and is now leading a broader political-military front that includes additional anti-government forces. The coalition’s formation expands the rebel alliance beyond M23 alone and is fighting the Congolese army in North Kivu. Security personnel linked to Erik Prince were ambushed, resulting in the death of a former New Zealand special forces officer and wounds to former UFC fighter Tim Kennedy. The conflict remains deadly, with 1,158 battle-related deaths recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/democratic-republic-of-congo-kabila-s-move-towards-m23-rebels-raises-questions-over-peace/a-79652262?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxOaFpkb2x2YmFxYWx1UThLcnFVZ2hGd1Vib3BNMWNLM1dYcXQzVmprTzRCb1UyOUV3Wl8waW92YkNPbWVlU1JfRWhEbmQ5YmJROWhpMTlCM1hBaXY4ZWxhSG1GUHRkZzRZRlV2RlBmdnIxWXlNSG9JdG9vejFpcFdUTXlvNy1JQXlrRzFPUmd1d1ZWdGNSMExCdVF1bzcyZWx3bERzdjVqVjgwYnRuWUdJakRWVmJXR2YzdTVaaE930gG-AUFVX3lxTFBycENpLVNQbmdFN0hONWRWWW8ySlFvdXpOckZQc2gxbXphaU9mZTRsZVhWRDdzdGZqTWxRM3p4Z0VfUW1GNWd2Y2c0QlVoWUtrWlpCUWtISU16S21jdXI0NDVfX1dkVkZqVXBlQ1pBUzNsTlVGcWZBQTlVRjFkOEZXVmVtSDJGeUNUOHNmaWE3Y1h2bGNtT3VfZ3NjaVNsdlN2YzNUZDJfeE0xOXNRd2ZCUlFtY2FralNyODVXTkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidEFVX3lxTFBpRXJZM3Y4QmxCZkwwLUxlb3lWTExlV0V4a2VzbURlTTF4UWZWVWVjVGVVWDdxMVU2blNiM1E5WnU0dExFUXVsaDA2V0tDNS1SV3NNWWh4RUNmaEV5bG9DenFpZlE4bVBBcE9FNWZjTGYxRklx?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?o